    "sentence_translations": [
      "How painful are menstrual cramps?",
      "",
      "In medical terms, pain can be classified into 12 degrees.",
      "Insect bites are understood as the 1st degree, while giving birth is the 12th degree.",
      "But some girls’ menstrual cramps can get to the 8th degree, worse than being beaten by sticks, which is considered as the 7th degree.",
      "So, when your girlfriend is having menstrual cramps, be sure to take good care of her, do not upset her.",
      "Otherwise, once she recovers, you will be experiencing the 7th degree of pain."
